Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.82,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.82,0:03:32.06,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それは嫌だろう
