Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.98,0:02:14.44,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.06,0:02:19.98,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己沒有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.31,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但這能成為苟且偷生的藉口嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.55,0:02:38.01,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在內心深處響起的悲鳴
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.12,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由誰來回應
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.12,0:02:44.02,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那麼幾次
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.96,0:02:48.76,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做個正直的當事者
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.17,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.19,0:02:57.73,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.06,0:03:02.45,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.45,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已經察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身體已無法停滯不前
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.08,0:03:11.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.33,0:03:14.95,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「這點恐懼便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.71,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.36,0:03:19.24,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放聲高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.17,0:03:21.56,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.57,0:03:24.31,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知曉
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.60,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.82,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在這裡結束嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.82,0:03:32.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}這絕非你所願吧
